":25,"source_sha256":"ff5c93a801ae8a90395dc547625f72b476d17515c9dc64215ed1a6d213b79c68","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":20},{"dia_id":"D25:21","global_turn_index":445,"locator":"[S25T21]","raw_turn_sha256":"bd6e4f348d7218c6e3688cb35c7e7ad63f65f5225ae394de43be8b84bc23c0a5","rendered_turn_sha256":"53de5c2ae3c5f09c98c5dcd90d7510b9457c1498d5010019bf13a1db4ec0f203","session_date":"2023-10-23","session_datetime":"2023-10-23T14:17:00","session_id":"session_25","session_index":25,"source_sha256":"01851d618a01cd31826e07854775daea99bcdac5bcbaa0d7e1b3795328697f08","speaker":"Dave","turn_index":21},{"dia_id":"D25:22","global_turn_index":446,"locator":"[S25T22]","raw_turn_sha256":"b76f0c6e68826546ef6b1d8233906cffcbecdc9cf9bbf7d98100c92ac8a8a7f3","rendered_turn_sha256":"4f8afb0a1550452cae420d32ca551b6bdb29bf814232fe44d6f239bec8c9384f","session_date":"2023-10-23","session_datetime":"2023-10-23T14:17:00","session_id":"session_25","session_index":25,"source_sha256":"7143319e2b7850e13bd780af792ccf0f70974c59cce452ce01f266ed21efce38","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":22},{"dia_id":"D25:23","global_turn_index":447,"locator":"[S25T23]","raw_turn_sha256":"07add8fe3685281550d807173fe022e3f7a4859d1e530ae0fe51ac38481b66e8","rendered_turn_sha256":"45e416e3bb1390fce9ce6808001c1c6be623d8ae3e3f3e394434d56dc96630ce","session_date":"2023-10-23","session_datetime":"2023-10-23T14:17:00","session_id":"session_25","session_index":25,"source_sha256":"b15104056d3eb16fab988a0afa9851d4792df1fc818a204884f071b540296b2b","speaker":"Dave","turn_index":23}],"speaker":null,"store_id":"s3","store_snapshot_sha256":"983238fddc77a88ef4ae3d06b50bcfd25a429f497e89c6af4d9477cefca9cad2","text":"- On 2023-10-04, told Dave he met with some \"incredible\" artists in Boston the day before (2023-10-03) and talked about working together — the meeting was arranged through a mutual friend (\"knew we'd be a great fit\"); he found it \"inspiring and exciting\" because each artist has an individual style, and he's \"stoked to collaborate with them on new music\"; when Dave asked about it and to let him know how it goes, Calvin: \"Can't wait to show you the final result.\" [S21T1][S21T2][S21T3].\n- On 2023-10-04, when Dave asked what he works on to relax, Calvin shared a photo of a shiny orange car with its hood open and said he loves working on this project \"to chill out\" (a car project Calvin is working on himself — distinct from his own Ferrari, see ## New luxury car (Ferrari, 2023-03-26); makes sense given his long-standing finding that working on/fixing cars relaxes him \"like meditation,\" see the 2023-05-31 entry in ## Relationships) [S21T3].\n- On 2023-10-15, when Dave (feeling discouraged after his shop lost a deal to a competitor) asked how he stays motivated when faced with setbacks: \"When setbacks come my way, I remind myself why I'm passionate about my goals. I rely on helpful people around me and take a break to recharge with my favorite activities. That always helps me get back to feeling motivated.\" (complements his earlier 2023-07-21 answer about staying motivated, see above) [S23T3][S23T4].\n- On 2023-10-15, said performing with Frank Ocean \"recently has been really cool\" — said while reacting to Dave's music-festival story (see ## Relationships); the Frank Ocean tour he described to Dave on 2023-08-14 as having ended with the Tokyo show predates this remark, which suggests more recent performing with Frank Ocean (details in ## Frank Ocean collaboration; confirmed on 2023-10-19, when he told Dave he has started touring with Frank Ocean — see ## Frank Ocean collaboration) [S23T10].\n- On 2023-10-23, on the balance and pressure of touring/fame (complementing his earlier motivation answers, see above): the tour is incredible and energizing, but fame has its own challenges — balancing it all has been tough; he takes it one day at a time, it can get overwhelming with so many demands, but he enjoys what he does so he pushes on; a strong support system is a key strategy — his friends and team keep him on track [S25T2][S25T4][S25T6].\n- On 2023-10-23, when Dave asked (after Dave shared his good conversation with neighbors about current events and politics) how he stays informed and inspired: staying connected and up-to-date on world events is important to him — it helps his music stand out by incorporating unique perspectives, connects him better with his fans, and keeps him motivated and inspired [S25T8].\n- On 2023-10-23, told Dave (when asked whether anything had caught his eye lately and made an impact on his music, in the context of Dave's remark that art reflects the world): recently he's been really inspired by the struggles that people go through — it's made him dig deeper into his music to try to capture those feelings; when Dave asked whether using his music to share experiences and feelings is cathartic for him, Calvin: yes — it's a way for him to express himself and work through his emotions — \"like my own form of therapy\" (complements his earlier statements on music as self-expression, see above; conversation flow in the 2023-10-23 entry of ## Relationships; Dave's side in the Relationships section of /memories/dave.md) [S25T9][S25T10][S25T11][S25T12].\n- On 2023-10-23, the two agreed that attention to detail makes a big difference — in music or with vehicles, little things can make a big impact (Calvin: details are \"what makes something great, like a well-crafted rap song or a sleek and stylish car\") — and Calvin added that without those details it's just average, and that as an artist he wants to create something extraordinary; he shared a photo of his record (a silver disc in a black frame on a table), and Dave said he loves the attention to detail in Calvin's work — \"it makes it extra special. Keep on creating!\" (conversation flow in the 2023-10-23 entry of ## Relationships; Dave's amp photo in the Music section of /memories/dave.md) [S25T20][S25T21][S25T22][S25T23].","text_sha256":"66cc70a957276e818657b7f0faa1be53599fb54b1a574bfa567a5ecd4e9226a8","timestamp":null},{"attribution_index_sha256":"98109144a5a23da7a5b89634be2c543ea2366f2abe85f1f3f8a3df64a5e92ce2","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D29:13"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":160,"line_start":160,"source_locators":["[S29T13]"],"text_sha256":"f49f18c6f76f6e4f8762fe111958be419591c03c63966c06dfb9f35df039ebc4"}],"dia_ids":["D29:13"],"evidence_id":"ev-7c93254c96da23a25535118ef42da9a1453ecf75a8b0a06b11702f031c454114","group_id":"/memories/calvin.md > # Calvin","line_end":160,"line_start":160,"observation_ids":["obs-0004"],"path":"/memories/calvin.md","query_terms":[],"rank":null,"records_sha256":"130a5a1e1b75083358ef27a98dd215a4e75c819ace6f2ee9b560ba394e0f0394","retrieval_round":6,"schema_version":1,"score":null,"section":"# Calvin > ## Music","selection_ordinal":2,"session_id":"session_29","source_kind":"curated","source_locators":["[S29T13]"],"source_map_sha256":"6e99115961bae06a48bfb7e82dbdcc18dc32ccf6c5ce57e3c266dfc7a5d4d574","source_records":[{"dia_id":"D29:13","global_turn_index":539,"locator":"[S29T13]","raw_turn_sha256":"f403014a61337dcbe6748d6e2bff1bd7197fc7f0ef219c95d82cff3fa5afeea2","rendered_turn_sha256":"527e9ed03aca64039ddb76c197b5c4bb6b5c141605beacff2e58418a91b34568","session_date":"2023-11-13","session_datetime":"2023-11-13T21:15:00","session_id":"session_29","session_index":29,"source_sha256":"c0bd7e54be6af1793c17795efd1052097f086b58fab87e5891d3e7636668b042","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":13}],"speaker":"Calvin","store_id":"s3","store_snapshot_sha256":"983238fddc77a88ef4ae3d06b50bcfd25a429f497e89c6af4d9477cefca9cad2","text":"- On 2023-11-13, said he's \"stoked [he] made a difference\" — \"paying it forward\" — and that working with new talent brings new ideas to his work; shared a photo of himself making a beat for a young artist (a photo of a man sitting at a desk in front of a computer), saying the artist has great potential in music (Dave: \"Wow, that's cool! Your music studio looks great.\") [S29T13].","t